{"name": "EverRail", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/e2e6a74cd05e887945c85dbc72af8ec8.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/0b3d61d8d59d64344a7e328c084ca712.poster.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/0b3d61d8d59d64344a7e328c084ca712.webm?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/0b3d61d8d59d64344a7e328c084ca712.mp4?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your train is your only refuge in an endless frozen world. When you die, another passenger steps forward and takes your place. As long as survivors remain, your journey continues. <strong>Rescue trapped passengers scattered in abandoned facilities across Inara</strong> and build up your society one survivor at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/7fa46788d71d3697571c1528755e082c.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/1a7c0586907cb19df2018edba1df3d30.poster.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/1a7c0586907cb19df2018edba1df3d30.webm?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/1a7c0586907cb19df2018edba1df3d30.mp4?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's your base, your shelter, and everyone aboard's last chance at survival. <strong>Explore the exomoon Inara solo or in co-op with up to 4 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/06e0102f55d13105c1f869e8c2e0f645.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/5354275c13624709838c2b0fa2febea8.poster.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/5354275c13624709838c2b0fa2febea8.webm?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/5354275c13624709838c2b0fa2febea8.mp4?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission for survival lies above everything. Venture into dangerous locations filled with <strong>valuable resources, technology, hidden secrets, and unforgiving battles</strong>. But if you explore for too long, you may risk losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/8a901e954a904f3f71c38961d6b81393.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/8f3cedac818966ff17544ff747ef557f.poster.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/8f3cedac818966ff17544ff747ef557f.webm?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/8f3cedac818966ff17544ff747ef557f.mp4?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The train's <strong>battery recharges while it's moving and drains when it stands still</strong>. Every expedition and every decision you make revolves around this single rule. Manage your train's power, maintain its systems, and never let the battery reach zero or your journey ends. <strong>Move or freeze.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/eeb719b09a20bc6cd92e602bc1dbc24b.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/db49f1dc74c4d19d37998b942496de0a.poster.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/db49f1dc74c4d19d37998b942496de0a.webm?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/db49f1dc74c4d19d37998b942496de0a.mp4?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer Inara by <strong>crafting new weapons, armor, tools, gliders, and essential machinery</strong>. Expand and upgrade your train as you push farther along the tracks. <strong>Attach hundreds of new wagons</strong> to increase storage, boost production, and build out your own logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/110048969f8edd9f3c08744b90ced2c5.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/593267338228b380037ba335099a544d.poster.avif?t=1787157362\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/593267338228b380037ba335099a544d.webm?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/extras/593267338228b380037ba335099a544d.mp4?t=1787157362\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your glider puts eyes in the sky over the frozen landscape before you ever set foot on it. <strong>Scout new locations, harvest rare isotopes for crafting, and identify threats from above</strong> by deploying scan drones into the depths of Inara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Inara Never Looks the Same Twice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abandoned facilities, deadly anomalies, and survivors waiting to be rescued are scattered across a <strong>procedurally generated world</strong> that never repeats. Every run brings new routes, new dangers, and new reasons to keep the train running.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shape EverRail with us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The exomoon is called Inara because the community chose that name. The lore exists because players helped us refine it. Throughout Early Access, EverRail is built alongside the players. Features, systems, game balance, and story will continue to evolve based on the community that keeps the train running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So join our Steam Community and Discord and shape the game with us!<i><strong> </strong></i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Every passenger is a life. Every death brings the end closer. An open world survival crafting game where you explore, scavenge, and craft to endure on the frozen exomoon Inara. Command and upgrade your ever-moving train, solo or with up to 4 players. Move or freeze.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/a9ac500333406730bbabf503f872cf39165cfcfe/header.jpg?t=1787157362", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Open World Survival Craft", "Trains", "Perma Death", "Multiplayer", "PvE", "Survival"], "developers": "Aesir Interactive", "publishers": "Aesir Interactive", "release_date": "Jul 20, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "4134600", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "20 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/s-ILu3zBf58", "first_seen": 1784505600.0, "review_rank": 248}